<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-20T03:38:28.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:38:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran troops are conducting airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders, including an airstrike on Jeff's luxury mansion and the demolition of another stronghold, killing about 20 gang members. The Haitian government formalised a security pact with El Salvador, deploying Salvadoran forces who are now fighting gangs in Port-au-Prince, while street protests both support and oppose the foreign troops. The United Nations warned that anti-gang operations must prioritise civilian protection, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/19/haiti-police-say-at-least-34-suspected-gang-members-killed-in-raid?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/19/why-are-bukeles-salvadoran-troops-in-haiti-and-what-have-they-achieved?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/18/bukele-confirms-airstrike-on-haitian-gang-leader-jeffs-luxury-mansion&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOUHp5UXdvRXdscnFmZzdOTkJ2aGpoVzRra2U3Q3kyMmdPaXljdExsYXp1T0VrZ2tDUEctYzBZU05iZ0JNdDB5MHMwamFIUnBCdGNpd0taZUozTTQyWV9VRENnT3R3bUdTOEJ3NkFqRGNxTm9MWmRzQ2xPdG8ycWp3NDVyakNuSUQ3Nk03Z2wyWmE0N0NGZ2ZoYXUyN1VycnFxWlM0bHNUemZGcG_SAbABQVVfeXFMTmxHekRqX05oOHBHTzBLYzBUeENieEhBVTd6Ynp6ZHA1MnJpNHJDREdOd1l3bXJMa1dIZmtYTXU5ZEk0bUt0RU1aWlJTa1RXaHZEV0p6RjZaeXZuTlpnblZ4VW9zcTMyM2dFQTBoSjFORGhwdEI0M1NoVlVYUEg4TGR5YTZLWkpWU0h3MUlaX3dHMlQwVUxHcnptcU54LXJ6RHM4NEt6V2FMd0JobHJMbzk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261119-major-anti-gang-offensive-in-haiti-kills-34-su